          "name": "Caption",
          "fill": "#6B6578",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Front tab is always the deepest colour of the palette. Tabs drop out from the back as the mark shrinks (3 → 2 → 1), so the silhouette simplifies instead of blurring. Units are px at the master design size; the 48 master scales freely upward (gap stays 1/24 of the mark).",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
