          "type": "text",
          "id": "y2tQa",
          "name": "Caption",
          "fill": "#6B6578",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Never use azure #3066BE on ink (2.07:1) — the dark colourway swaps it for azure-400 #5C84C6. Cobalt is never a tab colour on dark. On cobalt, azure or imagery use mono paper. Wordmark: ink on light, paper on dark.",
